===Etymology===
From earlier ''*þweahan'' [ˈθwæɑ̯.hɑn], from {{w|Anglo-Frisian}} ''*þwæhąn'' [ˈθwæ.xɑ̃n], from {{w|West Germanic}} ''*þwahan'' [ˈθwɑ.xɑn], from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*þwahaną}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|*thwā}}, {{cog|osx|thwahan}}, {{cog|odt|thwān}}, {{cog|goh|dwahan}}, {{cog|non|þvá}}, {{cog|got|𐌸𐍅𐌰𐌷𐌰𐌽}}.

